---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="BikeStyle Mag was born to tell the story of where design meets urban cycling, promoting more sustainable city mobility without giving up on style."
>
  <section class="wrapper prose page">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <p>
      BikeStyle Mag was born to tell the story of where design meets urban cycling: bicycles,
      e-bikes and accessories designed for those who live city life on two wheels with taste
      and elegance, promoting more sustainable mobility without giving up on style.
    </p>
    <p>
      We speak to those who ride every day to get to work, to those who choose the bike in
      their free time, and to those who simply love a good frame, a clean line, a well-crafted
      detail. We select and tell the most interesting stories from the world of cycling
      design: from handmade frames to the most elegant e-bikes, from minimal city bikes to
      accessories built for everyday city use.
    </p>
    <p>
      We believe more sustainable urban mobility also comes down to style: more people choose
      the bicycle when it's not just practical, but beautiful to look at and to live with.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page {
    padding-block: var(--space-6) var(--space-8);
  }
</style>
